		dphase\-seg2 PHASE\-SEG2 [dsjw SJW]]
		[loopback on|off] [listen\-only on|off] [triple\-sampling on|off]
		[one\-shot on|off] [berr\-reporting on|off]
		[fd on|off] [fd\-non\-iso on|off] [presume\-ack on|off]
		[restart\-ms TIME\-MS] [restart]
		[termination 0..65535]
